import{_ as i,o as t,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 322 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Causal Self-Discipline Absence: Time Travel and Causal Disturbance","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 322 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Causal Self-Discipline Absence: Time Travel and Causal Disturbance","no":322,"module":2,"tags":["Shrouding the Heavens","Causal Self-Discipline","Time Travel","Causal Disturbance","Cross-Plane"],"related":["28-Cross-Plane Anchor Connection","09-Reality-as-Basis Fundamental Stance","48-Judicial System and Adjudication Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0322_模块2-遮天-因果自律缺失.md","filePath":"en/0322_模块2-遮天-因果自律缺失.md"}'),s={name:"en/0322_模块2-遮天-因果自律缺失.md"};function o(r,e,l,c,u,d){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-322-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-causal-self-discipline-absence-time-travel-and-causal-disturbance" tabindex="-1">Entry 322 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Causal Self-Discipline Absence: Time Travel and Causal Disturbance <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-322-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-causal-self-discipline-absence-time-travel-and-causal-disturbance" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 322 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Causal Self-Discipline Absence: Time Travel and Causal Disturbance&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Shrouding-the-Heavens System (Entry 35) | Benchmark base: Documents 28, 09, 48</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-strong-ones-can-return-to-the-past-at-will-history-becomes-playdough" tabindex="-1">Introduction: When strong ones can return to the past at will, history becomes playdough <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-strong-ones-can-return-to-the-past-at-will-history-becomes-playdough" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: When strong ones can return to the past at will, history becomes playdough&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the <strong>causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires cross-plane operations to be strictly filed, observe first then limitedly intervene, only transmit knowledge back without disturbing causality. This entry dissects Shrouding-the-Heavens world&#39;s causal self-discipline absence in time travel and cross-plane operations — strong ones can backtrack, intervene, rewrite the past at will; the law of cause and effect is kidnapped by plot convenience. The law-first axiom requires: time travel must have rules, otherwise it is predation on history. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = medium (oligarchic civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Causal disturbance&#39;s waste:</p><ul><li>Willful backtracking makes the same historical event repeatedly modified; &quot;what actually happened&quot; loses certainty</li><li>Strong ones&#39; interventions mess up causal chains; civilization that could have naturally evolved is repeatedly interrupted</li><li>Readers&#39; trust in history collapses — since the past can be changed, does history still mean anything?</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Causal self-discipline absence&#39;s regression:</p><ol><li><strong>History uncertain</strong>: the past can be rewritten; civilization loses stable memory</li><li><strong>Causality imbalanced</strong>: strong ones&#39; willful interventions create karma debt; the future must repay</li><li><strong>Historical learning invalidated</strong>: since the past can be changed, learning from history loses meaning</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ye Fan&#39;s side&#39;s cross-time, cross-plane operations are the causal version of predatory thinking:</p><ul><li><strong>Willful backtracking</strong>: to save someone, to change a situation, willfully return to the past</li><li><strong>Take without giving</strong>: take resources and knowledge from the past / other worlds, but bear no causal cost</li><li><strong>Karma debt unrecorded</strong>: disturbances Ye Fan makes have no bookkeeper; civilization&#39;s causal ledger is a mess</li></ul><p>Causal self-discipline also has a real-world analogy: it is like civilization&#39;s accounting system. Every cross-plane operation is an entry; must be registered, must be traceable, must have someone responsible. Shrouding-the-Heavens world has no such accounting, so strong ones willfully withdraw resources from the past and other worlds without ever keeping books — when karma debt accumulates beyond repayment, it erupts as a &quot;great calamity.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Alaya Network + Symbiotic Court is essentially this causal accounting system: observe first (reconcile), then limitedly intervene (small payment), only transmit knowledge back (transfer only, no cash withdrawal). A civilization without accounting will sooner or later go causally bankrupt.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Shrouding Causal Disturbance</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou Causal Self-Discipline</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Strong ones willfully backtrack</td><td>Cross-plane operations strictly filed</td></tr><tr><td>Intervene then observe</td><td>Observe then limitedly intervene</td></tr><tr><td>Take without giving</td><td>Only transmit knowledge back, no causal disturbance</td></tr><tr><td>Karma debt unrecorded</td><td>Symbiotic Court adjudicates causal disputes</td></tr><tr><td>History can be changed</td><td>Reality as basis, history cannot be changed</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: list all time-travel / cross-plane operations in Shrouding</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: count each operation&#39;s disturbance magnitude on causal chains</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: after disturbances accumulate, future timeline&#39;s chaos degree</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: conclusion — causal self-discipline absence makes Shrouding&#39;s historical timeline highly chaotic late, mutually causal with the crossover contradictions in Entries 315 and 316</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Causal setting self-consistency</strong>: low — time-travel rules vague</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk</strong>: high — &quot;can change the past&quot; = &quot;can change anything,&quot; rules completely invalid</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: medium — Ye Fan&#39;s causal disturbances serve his plot needs</li></ul><p>Causal self-discipline is also closely tied to Myriad Races republicanism: cross-plane operations are dangerous not only because they disturb history, but because they let strong ones bypass Myriad-Rank consensus to directly change the world. If Ye Fan returns to the past to save one person, that saved person may change the entire civilization&#39;s trajectory in the future — and Myriad Ranks know nothing, never consented. Heng Yuan Zhou requiring cross-plane operations strictly filed and only knowledge transmitted back is essentially taking the right to decide &quot;whether to change the past&quot; from individuals back to Myriad-Rank consensus.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: historical uncertainty, karma debt, historical learning invalidated</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: willful backtracking = predation on historical stability</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo has no time-travel problem; Shrouding&#39;s causal chaos worsens its late retcon</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: causal disturbance affects all Myriad Ranks, yet decided unilaterally by strong ones</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: causal self-discipline is the precondition for cross-plane operations</li></ul><p>Causal self-discipline is also tied to civilization&#39;s &quot;accumulatability.&quot; A world where causality can be willfully disturbed cannot accumulate civilization — because what was accumulated yesterday may be overturned by today&#39;s time traveler. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s causal self-discipline ensures the stability of civilization accumulation: yesterday&#39;s achievements will not be erased by future interventions. This is the precondition for civilization to advance on the ten-thousand-year scale.</p><ul><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Time travel is not unusable, but must not be misused. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s causal self-discipline axiom is clear: you may observe, you may transmit knowledge back, but you may not treat others&#39; history as playdough. Shrouding&#39;s lesson: once strong ones can willfully change the past, the two words &quot;history&quot; of civilization are dead.</p><p>Causal self-discipline also requires &quot;time travelers&quot; to be responsible for their actions. In Shrouding, Ye Fan returns to the past to save someone, no one is held accountable; Heng Yuan Zhou requires every cross-time operation to be filed, consequences evaluated, karma debt borne. Time is not a private prop, but a civilization asset shared by Myriad Ranks.</p><p>In the final analysis, Shrouding-the-Heavens · causal self-discipline absence described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./315_模块2-遮天-完美世界联动.html">Entry 315 · Perfect World Crossover</a> · <a href="./316_模块2-遮天-圣墟联动.html">Entry 316 · Sacred Ruins Crossover</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/28-跨位面锚点连接.html">28-Cross-Plane Anchor Connection</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const m=i(s,[["render",o]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
